      "typical_award_size": "Fund balance $558,321.03 at July 1, 2025; $108,775.83 drawn and $205,734 committed to prior projects in FY 2025/26; $154,616.15 offered in the 2027 Action Plan NOFA ($56,199.01 Open to All, $13,251.59 Central County, $124,427.55 South County; North County and North Coast exhausted). Recent allocations: Rolling Hills III $89,978, Monterey Family Apartments $69,448, Cambria Pines $46,308, Arroyo Terrace $254,972, Balay Ko $228,641. 119 Title 29-assisted units complete in FY 2026/27.",
      "per_unit_cap": "Not published; awards have run $46,000 to $255,000 per project.",
