      "typical_award_size": "$149,238.80 of 2021 PLHA offered in the 2027 Action Plan NOFA under Plan Activity 2 (predevelopment, development, acquisition, rehabilitation and preservation of affordable rental and ownership housing including ADUs for workforce households up to 120% AMI). The NOFA states multifamily rental projects are not eligible under Activity 2 in this round. HCD formula allocations to the County: $612,437 (2024) and $656,010 (2025); five-year 2019-2023 total about $3.83 million. Past PLHA went to Arroyo Terrace and Cambria Pines.",
